# Platform Factory — hosted environment
# Copy these into Render → your service → Environment. Never commit the filled-in version.

# --- required: the factory refuses to start without this --------------------
# The only thing between the internet and a token that can deploy to your Vercel account.
FACTORY_PASSWORD=

# --- required: where businesses are written ---------------------------------
# Must sit on the mounted disk. A container's own filesystem is wiped on every
# deploy, so anything written outside the disk is gone at the next restart.
IDEAS_ROOT=/data/ideas

# --- required for deploying ------------------------------------------------
# https://vercel.com/account/tokens — scope it to the team below.
# Without it the factory still builds; every public target is refused.
VERCEL_TOKEN=
VERCEL_TEAM_ID=team_IJCVimnyQpzdln44DdE6KtVy

# --- optional: AI ideation --------------------------------------------------
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Without it the "describe it" box is disabled and the manual form still works.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# PORT is set by Render automatically — do not add it.
